   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2019-02-07",
   "text": "Corporate Political Disclosure Act of 2019\n This bill requires issuers of securities to, on an annual basis, publicly disclose political activity expenditures made during the previous year. The Securities and Exchange Commission must issue regulations to carry out this bill."
  }
